		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Softball-sized, pink, eyeless maw with bat wings and a stinger-tipped tail.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 11, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +2 (1d6) and 1 sting +2 (1d4 + red plague) or infest, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Infest</strong>. Gnaw into and inhabit a corpse, moving it like a puppet (as zombie but not undead). Urhag emerges if corpse is destroyed or as an action.</p><p></p><p><strong>Red Plague</strong>. CON 12+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON, spawning 1d4 larval urhags.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
